Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_DESC (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_DESC (.+?)
Value MGMT_ADDRESS (\S+)

Start
  ^Remote Chassis ID Subtype -> Continue.Record
  ^Remote Chassis ID:\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^Remote Port ID:\s+${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^Remote Port Description:\s+${PORT_DESC}\s*$$
  ^Local Port ID:\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s*$$
  ^Remote System Name:\s+${SYSTEM_NAME}\s*$$
  ^Remote System Desc:\s+${SYSTEM_DESC}\s*$$
  ^Remote Management Address:\s+${MGMT_ADDRESS}\s*$$
